{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvUoX9fmDCZo9iqyVF2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've finished reading all five screens and I'm writing up what I'd tell my son.\n\n---\n\nI decided only half of it. The account should cost me at most 10 shekels a month if I'm on what they call \"המסלול הבסיסי\". I'm going to ask the clerk which plan I'm actually on and what I paid last month. As for how much to keep in it, the page only made me think: enough for the month's expenses, and not tens of thousands. It says most banks pay no interest at all on the עו\"ש. I'm not moving anything until I speak to you and the bank. I'm fairly sure about the 10 shekels and not sure about the rest.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **Screen 1, \"חשבון עובר ושב\".** I was glad it was about the עו\"ש, which I know. Every bank has to offer a basic plan of up to 1 action at a clerk and up to 10 through the website, for up to 10.00 ₪ a month. Then there was a new rule with dates, 01.10.2026 and 01.07.2027, about 7.00 ₪, 5.00 ₪, 10.00 ₪ and 1.00 ₪. I lost my place in that line.\n2. **Screen 2.** If more than 15,000.00 ₪ stays in the account for a quarter, the law says the bank has to send me a notice offering alternatives. That's good to know. Then a box: after 10 years, 10,000 ₪ in the עו\"ש is worth 8,203 ₪, \"1,797 ₪ פחות\". That number stuck with me. There was a slider, but I didn't touch it.\n3. **Screen 3.** A brown chart going down, which I didn't try to read. Below it were three numbers: 8,203, 10,779 next to \"קרן כספית יומית\", and \"המחיר של להשאיר\" 2,576. That's a different number from the 1,797 a moment before, and it confused me. It says 3.25% is just \"הנחה של האתר, לא הבטחה\". I didn't open the folds.\n4. **Screen 4.** Only 4 of 8 banks pay interest on the balance, and only up to 10,000 ₪, at most 3%. Then \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות: אם בנק קורס, אין חוק שמחזיר לכם את הכסף\". That's where I got worried, because of our 400,000 in deposits. I stopped really reading after that.\n5. **Screen 5.** I just glanced at the table of words. The bottom line says \"אישי, לא מסחרי\". I don't know who is behind this site.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** קרן כספית יומית, מק\"מ, \"מזומן שקלי\", the little labels like BANK-17 and \"חוקים וכללים · 5\", the dotted underlines, and \"הטבה\" with dots under it. The grey text at the top, \"123 מקורות\", was too small and pale for me.\n\n**What bothered me**\n- The screen is black with grey letters, which is hard on my eyes.\n- Screen 2 started in the middle of a sentence. I think I missed the start of the part about interest.\n- Two different \"it costs you\" numbers, 1,797 and 2,576.\n- The sentence about deposits having no insurance frightened me, and nothing near it says what to do about it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1926,"cache_read_input_tokens":11757,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1926},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b753785-4ed9-4c06-8ba3-d5b99b5147ff","uuid":"c83291fd-ac4f-4e23-8666-c8e61f2edafd","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:56:57.664Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvUoLVJcErXoopdA39n"}
